    "tpa_score_new": "<ul>\n\t<li>Attendance and participation: 20%, individual</li>\n\t<li>Resume:&nbsp;20%, individual</li>\n\t<li>Speech reflection: 20%, individual</li>\n\t<li>Reading reflections (#1 and #2; each worth 20%): 40%, individual</li>\n</ul>\n",
